  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ghana Netherlands WASH Programme seminar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ghana Netherlands WASH Programme (GNWP) started in 2015 in Ghana. Several public-private partnership projects focusing on water, sanitation, and waste management are implemented under this partnership. At the final stage of the GNWP, this seminar will bring together implementers from the different programs to exchange lessons learned and discuss their exit strategy. Moreover, the lessons learned and best practices identified help guide the strategy development of the Embassy of the Netherlands in Accra for the coming years.</narrative>
  </description>
